1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,056
HUS HUS HUS!

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:04,010
Two in my mouth. One off my forehead.

3
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:05,460
A personal best.

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,020
Bea moved her drink.

5
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:08,720
Then she saw my notebook.

6
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:11,830
Day forty seven. Still rushing the third one.

7
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,820
Our cinema had one gold seat.

8
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,470
Catch three pieces of popcorn before the trailers

9
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:17,740
and it was yours for a year.

10
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,180
I didn't want fame.

11
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,580
I wanted a seat that didn't fold me in half.

12
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,530
On Friday nights my friends went out.

13
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:25,010
I stayed in the kitchen.

14
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,620
Same bucket. Same distance.

15
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,670
Slightly lower ceiling.

16
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,222
HUS HUS HUS!

17
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:33,780
One in the sink. One in the butter.

18
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,860
The third one stuck to the clock.

19
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:38,860
Ah, almost, almost.

20
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,580
Bea drew three dots in my notebook.

21
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:43,710
There was a gap before the last dot.

22
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:45,670
She made me watch my hand.

23
00:00:46,110 --> 00:00:47,950
On the third toss I was already reaching

24
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:48,880
back into the bucket.

25
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,880
For what? There's no fourth piece.

26
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:53,776
HUS HUS HUS!

27
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:56,120
Friday. Full house.

28
00:00:56,550 --> 00:00:57,710
The usher lifted the rope.

29
00:00:58,170 --> 00:01:00,380
I picked out three pieces and set the bucket down.

30
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:03,120
Two clean catches. Then I waited.

31
00:01:03,550 --> 00:01:05,010
Number three came straight down.

32
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,830
The gold seat was mine.

33
00:01:07,410 --> 00:01:08,610
Bea sat beside me.

34
00:01:09,040 --> 00:01:10,350
Her seat folded shut.

35
00:01:10,790 --> 00:01:13,600
Forty seven days of research finally paid off.

36
00:01:14,110 --> 00:01:17,030
I folded my notebook and wedged it under her seat.

37
00:01:17,490 --> 00:01:18,390
Now we had two.

38
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:20,590
Halfway through the trailers, I heard it behind me.

39
00:01:20,730 --> 00:01:22,060
Three entire rows.

40
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:22,630
Training.

41
00:01:23,270 --> 00:01:24,392
HUS HUS HUS!
